<%#
  Kamal renders this with only the accessory's env in ENV. CI exports the
  password; a workstation does not, so read it the way .kamal/secrets.prod does.
  Kamal stops the old container before rendering, so a blank value must fail
  here. Kamal renders without trim mode, so no text may sit between the tags.
%><%= ENV.fetch("POSTGRES_ADMIN_PASSWORD") {
  value = `.kamal/ssm-secret prod POSTGRES_ADMIN_PASSWORD`.strip
  raise "POSTGRES_ADMIN_PASSWORD is unavailable from SSM" unless $?.success? && !value.empty?
  value
} %>
